title: "MIDAS ThemeRiver"
abstract: >-
  An interactive, browser-based ThemeRiver visualization for exploring how
  research themes in infectious-disease modeling papers by MIDAS Network members
  shift over time, based on PubMed metadata.
type: software
authors:
